  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Students of the art of violence, fighters are defined by their weapon skills, and variety of martial techniques.</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Iconic Fighters</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Beowulf, English mythology</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Gilgamesh, Mesopotamian legend</span></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Sir Lancelot, Arthurian legend</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Playing Fighter</strong></b></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">The fighter is a mid-defense striker. In combat, get within effective distance for offense and prioritize the Attack Action.</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Action:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Attack</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Move:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Flexible</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Starting Pack:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Gladiator, Knight, Warrior, or Watchman</span></p><p><br></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Training</strong></b></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Weapons:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Melee, Ranged</span></p><p><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Skills:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"> Brawl or Finesse, and 3 from either Brawl, Detect, Finesse, Leadership, or Sneak</span></p>",
