        "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">You gain the Situational Awareness Perk (p. 72) and another Perk with the Melee or Ranged Training Prerequisite (p. 64), ignoring prerequisites for this Perk.</span></p>"
      },
