        "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The roll required for you to Crit on Attack Checks and Saves to Dodge or Block Attacks is reduced by 1, and is reduced by 1 more when you reach 4th and 8th Levels in this Class.</span></p>"
